(version 1)
(allow default)
; Offline run (spec/BRIEF.md ZR-1: "with the network disabled the run still completes"):
;   JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS=-Djava.net.preferIPv4Stack=true sandbox-exec -f scripts/offline.sb <command>
; Every outbound connection is refused, except:
;   - loopback, for Spark's driver, block manager and the JVM side of a local Connect server (Java must be IPv4-only:
;     its IPv6 loopback sockets are not matched by the "localhost" filter);
;   - port 15002, the local Spark Connect server: the Python gRPC client reaches 127.0.0.1 through an IPv4-mapped
;     IPv6 socket that the "localhost" filter does not match either (measured 2026-09-26);
;   - unix sockets (local IPC).
(deny network-outbound)
(allow network-outbound (remote ip "localhost:*"))
(allow network-outbound (remote ip "*:15002"))
(allow network-outbound (remote unix-socket))
